{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"創世記","commonName":"創世記","title":"創世記","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"c386c509bcaf2d2e415b454ca78f5cfd89495b0f945d3896fb5dab5baca206b4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["亞伯蘭跟羅得分手"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亞伯蘭帶着他的妻子與羅得，並一切所有的，都從埃及上南地去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["亞伯蘭的金、銀、牲畜極多。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他從南地漸漸往伯特利去，到了伯特利和艾的中間，就是從前支搭帳棚的地方，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["也是他起先築壇的地方；他又在那裏求告耶和華的名。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["與亞伯蘭同行的羅得也有牛群、羊群、帳棚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那地容不下他們；因為他們的財物甚多，使他們不能同居。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["當時，迦南人與比利洗人在那地居住。亞伯蘭的牧人和羅得的牧人相爭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["亞伯蘭就對羅得說：「你我不可相爭，你的牧人和我的牧人也不可相爭，因為我們是骨肉",{"noteId":5},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["遍地不都在你眼前嗎？請你離開我：你向左，我就向右；你向右，我就向左。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["羅得舉目看見約旦河的全平原，直到瑣珥，都是滋潤的，那地在耶和華未滅所多瑪、蛾摩拉以先如同耶和華的園子，也像埃及地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["於是羅得選擇約旦河的全平原，往東遷移；他們就彼此分離了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["亞伯蘭住在迦南地，羅得住在平原的城邑，漸漸挪移帳棚，直到所多瑪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["所多瑪人在耶和華面前罪大惡極。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["亞伯蘭遷往希伯崙"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["羅得離別亞伯蘭以後，耶和華對亞伯蘭說：「從你所在的地方，你舉目向東西南北觀看；"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["凡你所看見的一切地，我都要賜給你和你的後裔，直到永遠。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我也要使你的後裔如同地上的塵沙那樣多，人若能數算地上的塵沙才能數算你的後裔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["你起來，縱橫走遍這地，因為我必把這地賜給你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["亞伯蘭就搬了帳棚，來到希伯崙幔利的橡樹那裏居住，在那裏為耶和華築了一座壇。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"原文是弟兄","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}